{"title":"Skull Rock","slug":"Skull_Rock","hero":{"file":"Skullrock190823.webp","width":400,"height":197},"pageid":1034,"revid":13859,"timestamp":"2024-07-13T16:20:57Z","lastEditor":"Summars","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater, Desertlands Pillar"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Contains the Skull"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.25.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"14/07/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"skull-rock","text":"Skull Rock"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"skull-rock\">Skull Rock</h2>\n<p>The <b>Skull Rock</b> is located on one of the sandstone pillars in the desert. Where A boarded-up hole covered with wooden planks contains a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Skull/\">skull</a>. By using 3 small bombs on the planks, the planks will be destroyed and you can claim the skull. Its main purpose is being a part of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a> quest.  \n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: There is slanted rock at the side to climb up with to get to the top of the mountain\">There is slanted rock at the side to climb up with to get to the top of the mountain</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Climb_area.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><u>There is slanted rock at the side to climb up with to get to the top of the mountain</u></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Reference to path from top of pillar\">Reference to path from top of pillar</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Screenshot_2024-04-16_171135.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Reference to path from top of pillar</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: the updated location\">the updated location</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Updated_location.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>the updated location</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>outdated locations\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Previous locations\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Skull Rock (After the 16th of July Update)\">Skull Rock (After the 16th of July Update)</span></span><br>The Skull Rock before being exploded.\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Skull Rock Open\">Skull Rock Open</span></span><br>The Skull Rock after being exploded.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>In version 1.25.0, the Skull Rock was on Finlay Island.</li></ul>"}
